    "description": "First-launch sheet, next to a check mark: what is counted and where it is kept. Must agree with the privacy notice at getemotely.com/app-privacy. Part of the versioned usage-analytics wording: changing it means bumping usageAnalyticsVersion."
  },
  "usageAnalyticsNever": "Never your answers, entries or name",
  "@usageAnalyticsNever": {
